# Apps Script safety

`AGENTS.md` is authoritative.

- Keep web-app access `DOMAIN` and execution `USER_DEPLOYING`.
- Static/Canvas use no OAuth scopes. Sheet uses Advanced Sheets Service with `spreadsheets.readonly`.
- Whitelist fields before HTML serialization and escape closing-script sequences.
- Keep sample data fictional, pages self-contained, and mobile smoke selectors intact.
- Run `npm test` after changes.
